# Factory baseline for every consumer repository (KAN-83 item 6). Copy it into a new repository, or
# append the lines a repository is missing; keep the repository's own exclusions. Local agent
# settings and environment files never enter version control. Sanitized .env.example files stay
# tracked. A .gitignore does not untrack a file already committed: the factory's secret scan covers
# tracked files and history.
.claude/settings.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
